+
+  # Deliver exactly once: only a pending delivery can be claimed, under
+  # the webhook's row lock, so duplicate jobs, duplicate triggers,
+  # retries or concurrent workers can never POST the same event to the
+  # same webhook twice (see also Webhook#trigger).
+  def deliver
